<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3925/30 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7163/68 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9306/11 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4605/15 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.41/42  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7913/23   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1706.4/7.4  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     126.15/20   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6808/82   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0703/53   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5376/86   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6233/40</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$340.50/00</p>
</text>
